<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="ruby-sanctum">Updates for Best in Slot Gear in Ruby Sanctum</h3>
<a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4987/the-ruby-sanctum">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Ruby Sanctum</span></a> has a few upgrades to improve our BiS setup. Namely the cloak, bracer, ring, and trinket drops. There are also a few intermediary upgrades that come out of 10M to bolster our setups while gearing up. Overall, it's a worthwhile raid to add to our lockouts.<br/>
<br/>The most impactful drop is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54589/glowing-twilight-scale">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubysanctum1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Glowing Twilight Scale</span></a>. This trinket is a throughput powerhouse with a triggerable effect similar to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50685/trauma">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_118.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trauma</span></a>. The on-use gives us the control to deliver the AoE healing when it is needed most, providing excellent value when triggered in the right situations. While triggering frequently, only 116 "buff seconds" are needed (6 people getting the full duration, 12 people getting half the duration, whole raid getting the 6s buff once, etc.) for this trinket to surpass others in terms of stat point equivalence, so it easily takes the BiS trinket slot as a throughput option.<br/>
<br/>After the trinket, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54583/cloak-of-burning-dusk">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloak of Burning Dusk</span></a> is the next biggest upgrade. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54582/bracers-of-fiery-night">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Fiery Night</span></a> look like an impressive upgrade, but they require a boot swap to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50665/boots-of-unnatural-growth">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_leather_8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of Unnatural Growth</span></a> due to pushing our haste rating well above cap. This results in just a moderate bump in healing power over <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50630/bracers-of-eternal-dreaming">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Eternal Dreaming</span></a> + <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50699/plague-scientists-boots">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Plague Scientist's Boots</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54585/ring-of-phased-regeneration">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownringb.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Phased Regeneration</span></a> is a great ring option that has slightly higher stats than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50636/memory-of-malygos">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Memory of Malygos</span></a>. It's availability also brings the value of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50400/ashen-band-of-endless-wisdom">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_85.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ashen Band of Endless Wisdom</span></a> into question, as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54585/ring-of-phased-regeneration">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownringb.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Phased Regeneration</span></a> + <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50636/memory-of-malygos">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Memory of Malygos</span></a> is a powerful combination that approaches the probabilistic value of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50400/ashen-band-of-endless-wisdom">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_85.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ashen Band of Endless Wisdom</span></a>, and provides smoother healing overall.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Frost for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 4</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49426/emblem-of-frost">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></a> will drop in ICC, the new VoA boss, and from the Heroic Daily quest. Badges should be used on your <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=887/lasherweave-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Lasherweave Garb</span></a> set as soon as possible as they are necessary to upgrade to higher ilvl T10 pieces. The other best gear to acquire is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50454/idol-of-the-black-willow">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_herbalism.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of the Black Willow</span></a>. This is our best idol and will be used for the rest of the expansion. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50358/purified-lunar-dust">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ammo_gunpowder_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Purified Lunar Dust</span></a> is also a great trinket that competes with trinkets like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45535/show-of-faith">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_improvedresistanceauras.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Show of Faith</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47432/solace-of-the-fallen">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_dungeon_ulduar77_25man.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Solace of the Fallen</span></a>. The rest of the gear that can be gathered with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49426/emblem-of-frost">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></a> are intermediate upgrades<br/>
