<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 4</h3>The Tier 10 shoulders <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51304/sanctified-lasherweave-pauldrons">
