<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 4</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54583/cloak-of-burning-dusk">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloak of Burning Dusk</span></a> from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4987/the-ruby-sanctum">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Ruby Sanctum</span></a> takes the BiS slot. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50668/greatcloak-of-the-turned-champion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrowncape.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greatcloak of the Turned Champion</span></a> is the best back option out of ICC. Only other competition should be warlocks and holy priests. If this isn't dropping for you then the most likely alternative is one of the ilvl 258 cloaks from TOGC like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48667/shawl-of-the-devout-crusader">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shawl of the Devout Crusader</span></a>, or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51848/heartsick-menders-cape">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heartsick Mender's Cape</span></a> out of 10M ICC. If you were lucky enough to get an ilvl 272 cloak from TOGC like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47554/lady-liadrins-conviction">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lady Liadrin's Conviction</span></a>, it is only slightly behind <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50668/greatcloak-of-the-turned-champion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrowncape.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greatcloak of the Turned Champion</span></a> in stats.<br/>
