<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="waist">Waist for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 4</h3>By a long shot <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50705/professors-bloodied-smock">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_59.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Professor's Bloodied Smock</span></a> will be BiS in both stats and contention. While <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50613/crushing-coldwraith-belt">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crushing Coldwraith Belt</span></a> is second BiS, it is very close in overall stats to the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49426/emblem-of-frost">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></a> belt <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50997/circle-of-ossus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_68.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Circle of Ossus</span></a> and the BoE normal mode <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50069/professors-bloodied-smock">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_59.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Professor's Bloodied Smock</span></a> so it's not worth fighting with casters over loot priority.<br/>
<br/>
