<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="feet">Feet for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 4</h3>With the introduction of <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4987/the-ruby-sanctum">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Ruby Sanctum</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50665/boots-of-unnatural-growth">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_leather_8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of Unnatural Growth</span></a> become BiS. This is due to pushing over haste cap with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54582/bracers-of-fiery-night">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Fiery Night</span></a>, and the haste swap in the boots slot being the most efficient option. becoming BiS over our haste swap  <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50699/plague-scientists-boots">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Plague Scientist's Boots</span></a> are still an incredibly strong option if you find yourself under haste cap. The craftable <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49894/blessed-cenarion-boots">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_leather_8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blessed Cenarion Boots</span></a> are a close runner-up. They are almost identical to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47454/sandals-of-the-mourning-widow">
