<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 4</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50400/ashen-band-of-endless-wisdom">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_85.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ashen Band of Endless Wisdom</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54585/ring-of-phased-regeneration">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownringb.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Phased Regeneration</span></a> are the BiS ring combination. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50400/ashen-band-of-endless-wisdom">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_85.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ashen Band of Endless Wisdom</span></a> has a random proc that is not typically desired in a healing role, but the probability math for the worst proc rate scenario still averages higher than the next best option. If you prefer to not have a random proc, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50636/memory-of-malygos">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Memory of Malygos</span></a> is your next best choice.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44636/enchant-ring-greater-spellpower">
