<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 4</h3>With the introduction of <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4987/the-ruby-sanctum">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Ruby Sanctum</span></a>, the best trinket combo is going to be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54589/glowing-twilight-scale">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubysanctum1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Glowing Twilight Scale</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50366/althors-abacus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Althor's Abacus</span></a>. With our end-game gear, regen from trinkets should no longer be necessary.<br/>
<br/>For a soft shift towards more regen, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50366/althors-abacus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Althor's Abacus</span></a> can be replaced with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47059/solace-of-the-defeated">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_dungeon_ulduar77_25man.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Solace of the Defeated</span></a>. For a hard shift towards more regen, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50366/althors-abacus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Althor's Abacus</span></a> can be replaced with either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46051/meteorite-crystal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_dungeon_ulduarraid_misc_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Meteorite Crystal</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45703/spark-of-hope">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_invisibilitytotem.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spark of Hope</span></a>, or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50454/idol-of-the-black-willow">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_herbalism.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of the Black Willow</span></a> can be swapped out for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40342/idol-of-awakening">
