<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 4</h2>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-restoration-druid-healer-phase-4">Main Hand Weapons for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 4</h4>
<a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46017/valanyr-hammer-of-ancient-kings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_99.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Val'anyr, Hammer of Ancient Kings</span></a> is still the BiS weapon. There are a few fights in ICC where <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50685/trauma">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_118.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trauma</span></a> can perform better, and Heroic Lich King benefits from swapping between the two during Ledge and Shadowmourne phases. The next best options are two highly contested caster weapons off Heroic Lich King.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50685/trauma">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_118.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trauma</span></a> will be relatively free loot, and the proc can be very powerful in the right circumstances. If <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50685/trauma">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_118.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trauma</span></a> is your best option, only swap to a raw stat increase on fights where raiders need to be constantly spread out for mechanics. In those situations, the proc will do next to no additional healing.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60714/enchant-weapon-mighty-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Mighty Spellpower</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44629/enchant-weapon-exceptional-spellpower">
