<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="idols-for-restoration-druid-healer-phase-4">Idols for Restoration Druid Healer Phase 4</h4>In Phase 4, it is finally time to hard swap our relic to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50454/idol-of-the-black-willow">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_herbalism.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of the Black Willow</span></a>. With the increase of stats on gear and regen available from trinket swaps, the regen from <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40342/idol-of-awakening">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thegoldencheep.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of Awakening</span></a> won't be necessary and we can fill the slot with a massive spell power upgrade. Only one rolling <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=48441/rejuvenation">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_rejuvenation.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rejuvenation</span></a> is required to keep the buff going, so it should be active consistently through all encounters.<br/>
<br/>If a difficult fight does find you low on mana, idols can be swapped mid-combat to benefit from the reduction in <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=48441/rejuvenation">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_rejuvenation.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rejuvenation</span></a> cost.<div class="pad"></div>
